Package: riskGenerateR
Title: Synthetic Spatial Risk Data Generation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(
      given = "Robert",
      family = "Andronaco",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "data@georiskanalysis.com"
    )
Description: 
    Generate synthetic spatial risk datasets for testing,
    development, demonstrations, quality assurance,
    reproducible examples, and spatial risk workflows.
    Supports random point generation, grids, hexagons,
    irregular polygons, synthetic risk attributes,
    and bundled spatial risk scenarios using sf objects.
